<section class="review-section" id="overview">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><rect height="4" rx="1" ry="1" width="8" x="8" y="2"></rect></svg> Overview</h2>
<p>Juniper Mist AI represents a fundamentally different approach to network management. Unlike traditional vendors who added AI features to existing products, Mist was built from the ground up as an AI-native platform. Acquired by Juniper Networks in 2019, Mist has become the cornerstone of Juniper's AI-driven enterprise strategy.</p>
<p>The platform's crown jewel is Marvis — a virtual network assistant that uses natural language processing to answer questions, troubleshoot problems, and provide insights. Instead of digging through dashboards and logs, you can simply ask Marvis "Why is the conference room WiFi slow?" and get an actionable answer.</p>
<p>Mist covers the full network stack: wireless (Wi-Fi 6/6E), wired switching, and SD-WAN. Its cloud-native architecture means no controllers to deploy — everything is managed through a single cloud portal with AI continuously analyzing your network data.</p>
<div class="marvis-box">
<div class="icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="10" rx="2" width="18" x="3" y="11"></rect><circle cx="8" cy="15" r="1"></circle><circle cx="16" cy="15" r="1"></circle><path d="M9 7L9 9M15 7L15 9M12 2v5"></path></svg></div>
<h3>Meet Marvis: Your AI Network Assistant</h3>
<p style="color: var(--text-secondary);">"Why are users in Building A complaining about video calls?"<br/>Marvis analyzes the data and responds: "3 APs in Building A are experiencing high channel utilization during video calls. Suggested action: Enable band steering and add AP in Conference Room 2."</p>
</div>
</section>
<section class="review-section" id="features">
<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg> Key Features</h2>
<div class="features-grid">
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="10" rx="2" width="18" x="3" y="11"></rect><circle cx="8" cy="15" r="1"></circle><circle cx="16" cy="15" r="1"></circle><path d="M9 7L9 9M15 7L15 9M12 2v5"></path></svg> Marvis AI Assistant</h4><p>Conversational troubleshooting with natural language. Ask questions in plain English and get intelligent, context-aware answers about network issues.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2"/><line x1="9" x2="9.01" y1="9" y2="9"/><line x1="15" x2="15.01" y1="9" y2="9"/></svg> Self-Driving Network</h4><p>Automated network optimization without human intervention. The AI continuously adjusts RF settings, identifies issues, and recommends remediation.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="18" x2="18" y1="20" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="20" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" x2="6" y1="20" y2="14"></line></svg> Service Level Expectations</h4><p>SLE dashboards measure actual user experience, not just infrastructure metrics. Track time-to-connect, throughput, coverage, and application performance.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"></path></svg> Root Cause Analysis</h4><p>Marvis automatically correlates events across the network to identify root causes. No more manual log analysis or guessing.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12.55a11 11 0 0 1 14.08 0"/><path d="M1.42 9a16 16 0 0 1 21.16 0"/><path d="M8.53 16.11a6 6 0 0 1 6.95 0"/><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="20" y2="20"/></svg> Wi-Fi Assurance</h4><p>AI-driven wireless optimization including dynamic channel and power management, client steering, and interference mitigation.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="12" y2="12"></line><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 014 10 15.3 15.3 0 01-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 01-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 014-10z"></path></svg> WAN Assurance</h4><p>Extend AI insights to SD-WAN deployments. Marvis monitors circuit health, application performance, and automatically routes around issues.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg> Location Services</h4><p>Patented vBLE (virtual Bluetooth LE) technology for indoor positioning. Enable wayfinding, asset tracking, and location analytics.</p></div>
<div class="feature-card"><h4><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M18 10h-1.26A8 8 0 1 0 9 20h9a5 5 0 0 0 0-10z"/></svg> Cloud-Native</h4><p>100% cloud-managed with no controllers to deploy. Updates happen automatically, and AI models improve continuously with global learning.</p></div>
</div>
</section>
