<h2><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 15s1-1 4-1 5 2 8 2 4-1 4-1V3s-1 1-4 1-5-2-8-2-4 1-4 1z"></path><line x1="4" x2="4" y1="22" y2="15"></line></svg> Pros &amp; Cons</h2>
<div class="pros-cons-grid">
<div class="pros-card">
<h3><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 11-5.93-9.14"></path><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"></polyline></svg> Advantages</h3>
<ul>
<li>Marvis AI is truly revolutionary</li>
<li>Best-in-class user experience metrics (SLEs)</li>
<li>100% cloud — no on-premise controllers</li>
<li>Conversational troubleshooting saves hours</li>
<li>Excellent wireless performance</li>
<li>Strong SD-WAN integration</li>
<li>Built-in location services</li>
<li>Modern, intuitive UI</li>
<li>API-first architecture</li>
<li>Continuous AI improvement</li>
</ul>
</div>
